# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. A non-interleaving digest read closes the #4914 cycle one call later.
MODULE: DigestQueuedBehindTurn
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the digest read queues behind the leaf's running turn
PERTURBS: ServeDigest

--- FIND
    /\ Admits(l, DigestInterleaves)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: GetChildDigestSnapshotAsync is not [AlwaysInterleave]
    /\ Admits(l, FALSE)
--- END
